      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pscelestinus.encomium.budge:56-103",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ϣⲁⲓⲣⲡⲙⲉⲉⲩⲉ ⲛⲧⲙⲛⲧϭⲁⲓⲉ ⲛⲛⲥⲱⲙⲁ ϩⲛⲛⲧⲁⲫⲟⲥ · ⲙⲛⲡⲉⲩ**ⲥϯⲃⲱⲱⲛ** ·",
      "english": "I used to remember how the flesh of men goeth to corruption in the tomb, and the foetid humour which it giveth forth.",
